{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/q0arxu","slideIndex":3,"text":"Setup: seed 305, 20 identical task objects, fresh default nodes for each policy. Actual: both placed 12, rejected 8, and used the same Edge/Fog/Cloud placement counts 3/2/7. Lowest-latency-first met 7 QoS targets with mean simulated latency 46.58 ms; capacity-aware met 8 at 46.59 ms. CPU/RAM utilization percent by Edge/Fog/Cloud: lowest-latency-first 87.5/87.5, 62.5/87.5, 57.8/100; capacity-aware 87.5/87.5, 56.2/87.5, 59.4/100. Evidence: results/experiments/policy_comparison.csv, policy_comparison.json, policy_comparison_chart.png."}
